trestle (0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Anti-spoofing: containers may only use their own MAC and IP.
  * Isolation between users or containers on a bridge.
  * Stale state cleanup (start, gc_interval, trestlectl gc); CNI 1.1.0 GC
    and STATUS.
  * trestlectl admin tool.
  * ipam = dhcp: leases from the LAN DHCP server.
  * Fixed MAC address on bridges trestle creates.

